#ASSERT `s 96(8.7) the refund of part of the employer's premium for 2011` 10_000 TRUE 10_500 TRUE (YMD 2012 3 1) EQUALS `ei3 a refund is payable` 500
#ASSERT `s 96(8.7) the refund of part of the employer's premium for 2011` 10_001 TRUE 10_500 TRUE (YMD 2012 3 1) EQUALS `ei3 no refund is payable under the provision`
-- No 2010 premium was required: P1 is zero (8.8); P2 of 600 gives 600. The $2 gate: exactly 2 is not more than 2; 2.5 is.
